[$in title:Website structure]
[$in description:An idiomatic multi-page Moth website from entries and shared packages.]
[$in head:[language_theme_head]]

[navbar]
[sidebar]
init_docs_sidebar()!

[section, $md:
    # Website structure

    Start with a site folder, a shared package and one `@entry.moth` in
    each directory that produces a page.

    This pattern covers final-design module boundaries, shared declarations
    and where static and runtime work belong. Its Basic and Advanced examples
    are being developed in this section.
]

